An autonomous system may operate normally under one environmental condition.

A significant environmental change occurs.

The entity’s capability has not changed.

Its authority has not changed.

But its operational risk may have changed because:

Environmentₜ ≠ Environmentₜ₊₁

The DOS may therefore require reassessment.

This illustrates:

Risk is configuration-dependent.

